# Earflow Go API Gateway

Routes defined in `gateway.yaml` (listeners) and `gateway.artist.yaml` (artists). Code: `internal/auth/`, `internal/proxy/`, `internal/ratelimit/`.

## Adding a route

```yaml
- id: my_route
  match:
    type: prefix
    value: /api/my-service
  upstream: my_service
  policies:
    class: unsafe          # public | unsafe | stream
    require_user: true
    rate_limit: default
```

Register upstream name in gateway config/env. Run `go test ./...` in `backend/go-api-gateway/`.

## Must preserve

- CSRF on unsafe methods (`class: unsafe`)
- Session middleware before upstream proxy
- Strip client `X-User-Id`, `X-Service-Token` spoof attempts
- Stream routes use `class: stream` + `rate_limit: stream`

## Tests

Add/update tests in `internal/auth/` or `internal/proxy/` when changing session, CSRF, or routing behavior.
